Zerok Container (pwa-creator)

Owned by Nrupal Akolkar (https://nrupalakolkar.com) · Built with Muse by Meta (https://muse.ai/join).

Zerok is a zero-trust, zero-knowledge encrypted container for files and blobs.
Encryption happens on the client device; the storage server never sees keys,
passwords, or plaintext.

